Package: stremio
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 nodejs
Description: Current Stremio Linux shell for ARM64 RK3588 SBCs
 Unofficial native ARM64 build of Stremio's current GTK/libadwaita Linux shell,
 packaged for Ubuntu 26.04 and Orange Pi 5 Pro / compatible RK3588 systems.
 Includes a private current-upstream FFmpeg/libmpv V4L2-request stack for
 RK3588 hardware video decoding without replacing system multimedia libraries.
